{"id":"74836596676a64ea","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-comonad.md","title":"Definition — 余单子","display":"Definition — 余单子","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-comonad","aliases":["14-df-comonad"],"display":"Definition — 余单子","source_ref":"V.8 comonad definition and diagrams (1), printed 247; DjVu 129","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-functor]]","[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","[[14-df-identity-composite-functors]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-comonad"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-comonad</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 余单子"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"V.8 comonad definition and diagrams (1), printed 247; DjVu 129"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1f1269584b34ad4b\" href=\"?note=1f1269584b34ad4b\" title=\"14-df-functor\">14-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1bdaf4a293143165\" href=\"?note=1bdaf4a293143165\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation\">14-df-natural-transformation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dad26c5de724390a\" href=\"?note=dad26c5de724390a\" title=\"14-df-identity-composite-functors\">14-df-identity-composite-functors</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C\">\\(G:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为函子；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta:G\\Rightarrow G^2\">\\(\\delta:G\\Rightarrow G^2\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon:G\\Rightarrow1_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\varepsilon:G\\Rightarrow1_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 为自然变换候选。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G^2=G\\circ G\">\\(G^2=G\\circ G\\)</span>，函子复合及恒等函子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(1_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dad26c5de724390a\" href=\"?note=dad26c5de724390a\" title=\"14-df-identity-composite-functors\">14-df-identity-composite-functors</a>。此处 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 是余单子函子，与其它原子中的群符号没有关联。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{IsComonad}_{\\mathcal C}(G,\\delta,\\varepsilon)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)\\land\\operatorname{IsNatural}(\\delta,G,G\\circ G)\\land\\operatorname{IsNatural}(\\varepsilon,G,1_{\\mathcal C})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\bigl(G(\\delta_A)\\circ\\delta_A=\\delta_{GA}\\circ\\delta_A\\land G(\\varepsilon_A)\\circ\\delta_A=\\operatorname{id}_{GA}\\land\\varepsilon_{GA}\\circ\\delta_A=\\operatorname{id}_{GA}\\bigr).\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{IsComonad}_{\\mathcal C}(G,\\delta,\\varepsilon)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)\\land\\operatorname{IsNatural}(\\delta,G,G\\circ G)\\land\\operatorname{IsNatural}(\\varepsilon,G,1_{\\mathcal C})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\bigl(G(\\delta_A)\\circ\\delta_A=\\delta_{GA}\\circ\\delta_A\\land G(\\varepsilon_A)\\circ\\delta_A=\\operatorname{id}_{GA}\\land\\varepsilon_{GA}\\circ\\delta_A=\\operatorname{id}_{GA}\\bigr).\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源说明：以下来源定位与历史核对经历为所附原稿的记录；本次核对对象为本对话提供的数学笔记。</p>\n<p>这是单子的箭头对偶。余结合律两侧从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"GA\">\\(GA\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G^3A\">\\(G^3A\\)</span>，两条余单位律从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"GA\">\\(GA\\)</span> 到自身。原书使用保有限极限的余单子构造新的拓扑斯；该附加保极限条件属于后续定理的假设，不属于所有余单子的定义。</p>\n<p>来源：Mac Lane–Moerdijk，V.8 余单子定义及图 (1)，印刷247页；DjVu129右页。原稿记录曾完整读取129–131图页的本地 OCR；248–249页讨论单子的右伴随所诱导的余单子，该附加构造不属于本条定义。这里合并公式作用域，没有改变余结合律或两条余单位律。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"1f1269584b34ad4b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation","status":"resolved","id":"1bdaf4a293143165","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-identity-composite-functors","status":"resolved","id":"dad26c5de724390a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-identity-composite-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-identity-composite-functors","status":"resolved","id":"dad26c5de724390a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C$ 为函子；$\\delta:G\\Rightarrow G^2$、$\\varepsilon:G\\Rightarrow1_{\\mathcal C}$ 为自然变换候选。$G^2=G\\circ G$，函子复合及恒等函子 $1_{\\mathcal C}$ 采用 [[14-df-identity-composite-functors]]。此处 $G$ 是余单子函子，与其它原子中的群符号没有关联。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta:G\\Rightarrow G^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon:G\\Rightarrow1_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"G^2=G\\circ G","display":false},{"tex":"1_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{IsComonad}_{\\mathcal C}(G,\\delta,\\varepsilon)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(G,\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)\\land\\operatorname{IsNatural}(\\delta,G,G\\circ G)\\land\\operatorname{IsNatural}(\\varepsilon,G,1_{\\mathcal C})\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\;\\bigl(G(\\delta_A)\\circ\\delta_A=\\delta_{GA}\\circ\\delta_A\\land G(\\varepsilon_A)\\circ\\delta_A=\\operatorname{id}_{GA}\\land\\varepsilon_{GA}\\circ\\delta_A=\\operatorname{id}_{GA}\\bigr).\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"GA","display":false},{"tex":"G^3A","display":false},{"tex":"GA","display":false}],"bytes":2179,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-308","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-comonad|df-214 — 余单子]]"},{"id":"bbded1dd14481b99","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-comonad]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-154","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-comonad]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-259","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-comonad]]：V.8 comonad definition and diagrams (1), printed 247; DjVu 129"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-309","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-comonad|df-214 — 余单子]]"}],"outgoing":["1f1269584b34ad4b","1bdaf4a293143165","dad26c5de724390a"]}